  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Enter the workstation IP address to communicate with Quest.


    <color=#52D9EF>X
    + A</color>  Calibration

    During calibration, view the TCP from different
    angles.

    If its position stays fixed, calibration is complete.

    <color=#52D9EF>Pinch</color> 
    Select / drag point


    <color=#52D9EF>X</color>  Action chunk (release)

    <color=#52D9EF>A</color> 
    Ghost grippers (release)

    <color=#52D9EF>B</color>  Selection mode

    <color=#52D9EF>Y</color> 
    Last point


    <color=#52D9EF>L grip / R grip</color>  Close / open gripper

    <color=#52D9EF>L
    trigger</color>  Start / finish trajectory editing

    <color=#52D9EF>R stick
    click</color>  Interpolate anchor to

    last edit / chunk end


    <color=#52D9EF>L
    stick click</color>  Show / hide keyboard

    <color=#52D9EF>L stick</color> 
    Move keyboard while visible

    Up / down: farther / closer

    Left / right:
    move sideways


    <color=#52D9EF>Trajectory Map</color> (B to switch):

    Left
    pinch: drag. Right stick up/down: zoom.

    Release the right-hand pinch before
    adjusting the map.

    Reopen the map to reset position and size.'
